"Click Open Feedback Page to review your document in the feedback dialog, then upload it to FluxMarkdown’s attachment service before continuing to GitHub." = "点击打开反馈页面，在反馈对话框中检查文档，上传至 FluxMarkdown 附件服务后继续前往 GitHub。";

"Share attachment download link publicly" = "公开附件下载链接";

"Attachment submitted privately; only maintainers can retrieve it." = "附件已私密提交，仅维护者可取件。";

"A previous upload is saved. Continue to verify its receipt." = "已保存之前的上传状态，继续以确认收件回执。";

"Attachments go to FluxMarkdown (t.xykong.cc), privately by default. Only maintainers can retrieve private files; GitHub shows a reference only. Enable public sharing to publish a download link. Unlinked files expire in 7 days; private files within 30 days. You can delete uploaded files here." = "附件上传至 FluxMarkdown（t.xykong.cc），默认私密，仅维护者可取件，GitHub 只显示编号。勾选公开后才提供下载链接。未关联 Issue 的附件保留 7 天，私密附件最长 30 天；可在此删除已上传文件。";

"Diagram could not be copied or saved" = "无法复制或保存图表";

